# List of CVEs to ignore in our security scans in Publish workflow
# see https://aquasecurity.github.io/trivy/v0.53/docs/configuration/filtering/#trivyignore

# This is a vulnerability in the underlying golang stdlib crypto/tls library, which is used by `esbuild`.
# PlanDev is unaffected by this because the affected golang code only runs during the build process and does not affect users directly.
# For users, we are shipping built code, which means esbuild and therefore golang are never used.
CVE-2025-68121
